# Release signing for NorthEast Launcher.
#
# 1. Copy this file to keystore.properties (same folder). keystore.properties is git-ignored:
#    never commit it, and never commit the .jks file.
# 2. Replace every [PLACEHOLDER] below. Paths are relative to this folder (or absolute).
# 3. ./gradlew assembleRelease  →  app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release.apk
#
# Creating a key: see docs/RELEASE.md. Back up the .jks and these passwords somewhere safe
# (an encrypted drive). If the key is lost you can't update the installed app without
# uninstalling it first, which resets its settings.

storeFile=[PATH TO KEYSTORE, e.g. ../keys/northeast-release.jks]
storePassword=[KEYSTORE PASSWORD]
keyAlias=[KEY ALIAS, e.g. northeast]
keyPassword=[KEY PASSWORD]
